{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "acp/usage-two-agents-untrusted",
  "title": "Two ACP agents in one room retain their own untrusted accounting",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "Appendix A.9.1"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_channels/test_acp_usage_boundaries.py::test_two_real_sdk_sessions_in_one_room_reach_framework_hooks. Two real JSON-RPC pipes and the framework response hooks; no SDK-only scheduling is asserted.",
